BT /F2 18 Tf 72 700 Td (AI Security and Access Control Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 675 Td (MT&T Corporation - Effective Date: January 1, 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 660 Td (Classification: INTERNAL - CONFIDENTIAL) Tj ET
