0.5 0.5 0.5 RG 72 615 m 540 615 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 595 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 575 Td (This policy defines the security controls and access management requirements for AI systems) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 562 Td (within MT&T Corporation. It addresses authentication, authorization, network security, data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 549 Td (protection, and incident response specific to AI/ML workloads on the Databricks platform.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 516 Td (2. Authentication Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 496 Td (All AI platform access must use federated authentication through MT&T's enterprise identity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 483 Td (provider \(Azure AD/Okta\). Multi-factor authentication is required for all human users) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 470 Td (accessing AI resources. Service principals must use OAuth machine-to-machine tokens with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 457 Td (automatic rotation every 90 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 434 Td (Personal access tokens \(PATs\) are prohibited for production AI workloads. Development) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 421 Td (environments may use PATs with a maximum lifetime of 7 days and must be rotated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 408 Td (automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 375 Td (3. Authorization Framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 355 Td (Access to AI resources follows a role-based access control \(RBAC\) model with the following) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 342 Td (roles: AI Platform Admin - Full access to all AI resources, endpoint management, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 329 Td (governance views. Model Owner - Manage specific serving endpoints, view usage metrics,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 316 Td (configure alerts. Model Consumer - Invoke serving endpoints, view Genie rooms, access AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 303 Td (Gateway. AI Auditor - Read-only access to all governance views, audit logs, and cost reports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 290 Td (Data Scientist - Access to model training resources, experiment tracking, and development) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 277 Td (endpoints.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 254 Td (Unity Catalog fine-grained access controls must be applied to all AI-related tables, views,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 241 Td (and models. Row-level and column-level security must be implemented for views containing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 228 Td (sensitive user or cost data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 195 Td (4. Unauthorized Access Detection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 175 Td (The v_ai_access_audit view must be monitored continuously for unauthorized access patterns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 162 Td (The following events trigger automated alerts and investigation: Any request resulting in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 149 Td (HTTP 401 \(Unauthorized\) or 403 \(Forbidden\) response, More than 5 denied access attempts from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 136 Td (a single user within 1 hour, Access attempts to decommissioned endpoints, Access from IP) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 123 Td (addresses outside MT&T's approved network ranges, Service principal access from unexpected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 110 Td (workspaces.) Tj ET
endstream
