BT /F1 10 Tf 72 720 Td (The Security Operations Center \(SOC\) must investigate all high-severity alerts within 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 707 Td (hours. Confirmed unauthorized access attempts must be reported to the CISO within 24 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 674 Td (5. AI Gateway Security Controls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 654 Td (All external-facing AI endpoints must be routed through Databricks AI Gateway. Required AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 641 Td (Gateway configurations: Rate limiting - Maximum 100 requests per minute per user for chat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 628 Td (endpoints, Content filtering - Block PII, hate speech, and harmful content in both input and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 615 Td (output, Token limits - Maximum 4096 input tokens and 2048 output tokens per request for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 602 Td (standard users, Fallback routing - Primary and fallback model destinations with automatic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 589 Td (failover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 566 Td (AI Gateway usage is tracked via the v_ai_gateway_daily view. The security team must review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 553 Td (destination_model distribution weekly to ensure only approved models are being accessed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 520 Td (6. Network Security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 500 Td (Model serving endpoints handling Confidential or Restricted data must use private endpoints) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 487 Td (\(AWS PrivateLink\). Public endpoint access requires IP allowlisting. All AI platform traffic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 474 Td (must traverse MT&T's security inspection infrastructure. VPC peering for cross-workspace AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 461 Td (data flows must be approved by the Network Security team.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 428 Td (7. Incident Response) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 408 Td (AI-specific security incidents include: Data exfiltration through model serving responses,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 395 Td (Prompt injection attacks on foundation model endpoints, Unauthorized model deployment or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 382 Td (modification, AI Gateway bypass attempts, Anomalous token consumption indicating abuse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 359 Td (The AI Security Incident Response Plan \(AI-SIRP\) must be followed for all AI-related) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 346 Td (incidents. The plan is maintained by the CISO office and reviewed quarterly. Post-incident) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 333 Td (reviews must include analysis of system table data to identify root cause and prevention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 320 Td (measures.) Tj ET
endstream
